#   committed verbatim as scripts/fixtures/legacy-markers/tailoredtip-dependabot.fixture, and
#   test-dependabot-render.sh additionally diffs the render against THAT file rather than this
#   one, so this list cannot drift into being the only thing the render is checked against.
# fixture-note: THE regression case. The committed file carries this generator's marker under its
#   pre-rename producer name at template-version 2, so the ownership matcher calls it ours, while
#   its content diverged past anything v2 could render — a v2 reconcile collapsed all four lanes
#   onto "/" and dropped one of the two bun blocks. Every lane below must survive.
# fixture-note: cocoapods IS detected here (/app/ios, /app/macos) and deliberately renders no
#   lane: Dependabot has no cocoapods ecosystem at all. It drives the lockfile-sync-pod decision
#   instead (and tailoredtip gitignores Podfile.lock, so that workflow is skipped there too).
# ---8<--- ecosystem<TAB>directory, one rendered lane per line
